    },
    "enUS": {
      "description": "There must be more to being a master of the arena than this!   Perhaps the Pirate who runs the event at Gurubashi will know!",
      "dialogue": {
        "be2e25865b16395f4896": "Arr Me Hearty!   Gaining one Trinket be not enough to make ye master of the Arena!    Now tis the time to truly prove your steel.\n"
      },
      "summary": "Speak with Short John Mithril in the Stranglethorn Arena.",
      "title": "Arena Master",
